{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】旺角凌晨有兩輛的士相撞，六人受傷。</p>\n<p>兩輛的士車頭毀爛、零件散落一地，交通燈及鐵欄被撞毀。凌晨一時許，兩輛的士於洗衣街與弼街交界相撞，兩名司機及四名乘客受傷，在現場初步治理後，由救護車送往廣華醫院。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T23:32:38.594297+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T23:05:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:26:00.999269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:26:00.999269+00:00","content_hash":"abf9c95b96f9cb4ad1a935d3334c39f7bf224003fd4b2c30987044e6297c7e71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}